ication to engage with municipalities, partners and our team.</p><p><strong>Entrepreneurial Spirit:</strong> You thrive in a fast-paced startup setting and see limited resources as a chance to innovate. You are hands-on, proactive and a natural problem-solver.</p><p><strong>Language:</strong> Excellent German and English skills.</p><h2><strong>Admin:</strong></h2><ul><li><p>Time commitment: Internship, 6 months</p></li><li><p>Start date: asap</p></li><li><p>Location: Munich or Berlin, in office</p></li></ul><p>🤗 We know that perfect candidates don’t exist and we don’t have specific “minimum qualifications”. Curiosity, eagerness to learn, a passion to tackle climate change, a collaborative spirit and a growth mindset are most important to us.</p><h2><strong>Benefits</strong></h2><p>💸 <strong>Competitive Compensation Package: </strong>We value your skills and expertise. Enjoy a salary that reflects your impact.</p><p>🚀 <strong>Ownership & Growth from Day One: </strong>Take on responsibility from the start, tackle exciting challenges and accelerate your career with a steep learning curve.</p><p>🛖 <strong>Offices in Munich and Berlin: </strong>Join us at WERK1, Munich’s up-and-coming tech hub in the Werksviertel, or in our new Berlin office.</p><p>🎉 <strong>Team Events & Culture: </strong>Join a vibrant team with fun social events and a culture of open feedback and continuous learning.</p><p>💛 <strong>Exclusive Perks & Benefits: </strong>Stay active with an EGYM Wellpass / Urban Sports Club membership, plus enjoy discounts on top sustainability brands.</p><p><strong>Your team will be</strong></p><ul><li><p>Lennart (Chief of Staff), your day-to-day lead</p></li><li><p>Ruth (CEO & Founder)</p></li></ul><p><strong>Ready to apply?</strong></p><p>Note: We are currently only able to hire from inside the EU, please only apply if you are based in the EU or are allowed to work here.</p><p>Ark Climate is an equal opportunity employer, which means we do not discriminate on the bas