&lt;li&gt;Technical founder background. Databricks, AWS Bedrock, or Temporal experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep domain knowledge in healthcare, financial services, or government. Agent framework contributions (Strands SDK, LangChain, open-source MCP servers).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in German/French language will be an added advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity of AI governance, ethics, and regulatory requirements (e.g. GDPR, UK/EU AI Act)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
