global e-learning business.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">About AIHR</span></strong></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><span style="color:#000000">Founded in 2016 with the mission to future-proof HR, the </span><u><a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.aihr.com/"><span style="color:#1155CC">Academy to Innovate HR (AIHR)</span></a></u><span style="color:#000000"> has become the world’s market leader in online training for human resources (HR) professionals. We have a global customer base spread across 140+ countries, amongst which companies like Unilever, Reckitt, Goldman Sachs, Philips, Deloitte, Nike, Heineken, and UBS. It is our goal to continuously upskill and empower 1,000,000 HR Professionals.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><span style="color:#000000">We are an international team of 100+ people, driven by excellence, innovation, and a hunger to grow in everything we do. As such, we strive to provide the world’s best courses and excellent support to our customers while continuously optimizing every aspect of our work. With over 30 nationalities, our team is diverse, yet we all share a few traits: we're friendly, enthusiastic, and great team players.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><span style="color:#000000">Being a fast-growing company, working at AIHR means taking on a lot of responsibility and getting countless opportunities to develop yourself in new areas and the potential to craft your own role.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Role and Responsibilities</span></strong></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><span style="color:#000000">As our Senior Growth Marketing Manager, you'll play a key role in accelerating customer acquisition across our B2C and B2B businesses. Working closely with the Head of Growth Marketing and VP of Marketing, you'll help us achieve our ambitious growth targets, improve acquisition efficiency, and identify new opportunities to scale.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><span style="color:#000000">A core part of your role will be diving into performance data to understand what's working, what's not, and where our biggest growth opportunities lie. You'll work closely with our Performance Marketing Specialist to scale paid acquisition, challenge existing strategies, test new approaches, and support campaign execution where needed. You'll also collaborate with our CRO Specialist to identify opportunities across landing pages, website journeys, and conversion funnels, turning insights into experiments that drive more leads and revenue.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><span style="color:#000000">You'll bring a strong growth perspective to our email marketing efforts, working with the team to analyze nurture flows, promotional campaigns, and audience segments, and identify opportunities to improve performance. Beyond optimizing existing channels, you'll explore, launch, and scale new acquisition opportunities, including those emerging from the changing AI- and LLM-driven marketing landscape.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><span style="color:#000000">Most importantly, this is a hands-on role where you'll do more than develop strategies and bring ideas to the table. You'll actively execute initiatives yourself or work closely with the wider team to bring them to life. Whether you're launching a new campaign, testing an acquisition channel, or improving conversion, you'll take ownership of turning opportunities into measurable business results.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">On a typical week</span></strong><br></p><p><span style="color:#000000">It's Monday morning, and you start the week with a coffee and a look at last week's acquisition performance. You open GA4, HubSpot, and your marketing dashboards to see how we're tracking against our B2C and B2B MQL targets. While digging into the data, you notice that one of our paid campaigns is generating plenty of traffic, but conversions have dropped. You investigate further, identify a few potential causes, and head into the Growth Marketing stand-up with some ideas to improve performance.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><span style="color:#000000">After the stand-up, you catch up with our Performance Marketing Specialist to review campaign performance and discuss opportunities to scale. You identify a promising new audience and agree to test a different creative approach. Rather than just handing over your ideas, you jump into the advertising platform to help set up the campaign and work with the team to get the new creatives ready for launch.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><span style="color:#000000">On Tuesday, you're focused on improving our B2B acquisition funnel. You've spotted an opportunity to increase conversions on the AI for HR Boot Camp landing page. You meet with our B2B Marketer and CRO Specialist to review the data, discuss your hypothesis, and agree on an experiment. You brief the team, align with sales on the proposed changes, and help move the experiment towards launch.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><span style="color:#000000">Wednesday is a work-from-home day, giving you time to dive deeper into our acquisition strategy. You've been exploring how AI and LLMs are changing the way HR professionals discover training providers. You identify a potential new acquisition opportunity, research the market, and put together a practical plan to test it. Later, you meet with the Head of Growth Marketing to challenge your assumptions, refine the approach, and agree on the next steps.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><span style="color:#000000">On Thursday, you review the performance of our B2C email nurture flows with the Email Marketing team. You notice an opportunity to improve conversions from leads to MQLs and propose a change to the messaging and sequence. After lunch with colleagues in the office, you turn your attention to an upcoming quarterly campaign, working with the wider Marketing team to finalize the messaging and coordinate the launch. You also start investigating new channels that could help expand the campaign's reach and attract new audiences.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><span style="color:#000000">Friday starts with reviewing the results of a recent landing page experiment. The changes have improved conversion, so you work with the CRO Specialist to roll them out more broadly. You also catch up with our BizOps team to improve HubSpot reporting, ensuring we have better visibility into acquisition performance and opportunities for growth. Before wrapping up the week, you review progress against our growth priorities, share your findings with the team, and identify the next opportunities worth pursuing.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><span style="color:#000000">After a productive week of analyzing, experimenting, and driving initiatives forward, you close your laptop and join your colleagues for Friday drinks.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">We offer</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#000000">A revenue-generating role in a fast-growing scale-up company;&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Competitive, benchmarked compensation;</span></p></li></ul><ul><li><p><span style="color:#000000">A high degree of autonomy in a vibrant, result-driven, inclusive, and international team;</span></p></li></ul><ul><li><p><span style="color:#0E101A">A beautiful office right across Rotterdam Central Station (Milleniumtower) and a satellite office in Amsterdam;</span></p></li></ul><ul><li><p><span style="color:#0E101A">26 paid holidays per year + 1 extra day for the first 5 years you work at AIHR</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#0E101A">Exchange any 2 public holiday days for 2 other days of your choice;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#0E101A">Work from anywhere policy, where you can work abroad for 20 days in a calendar year;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#0E101A">Pension plan;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#0E101A">4 Trust days per year (ad-hoc recovery days to take whenever you're overwhelmed, exhausted, or need to deal with something personal);</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#0E101A">Access to OpenUp mental health platform;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Personal development budget, training, and we pay for the books you read;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">All public transport expenses covered (NS Business Card);</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">MacBook + all other equipment you need to do your work;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Daily lunch prepared by a chef, weekly drinks, and fun team activities;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Free access to the office gym.</span></p></li></ul><p><span style="color:#000000">Get a taste of AIHR experience and check out our </span><u><a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://aihr.recruitee.com/benefits-guide"><span style="color:#1155CC">AIHR Benefits Guide</span></a></u><span style="color:#000000">!</span></p> <br> <p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Who you are</span></strong></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><span style="color:#000000">We're looking for an ambitious, data-driven, and commercially minded growth marketer with an entrepreneurial spirit. Someone who loves identifying opportunities, challenging existing approaches, and turning ideas into measurable results. You're not just a strategic thinker; you're equally excited about getting operational, executing ideas yourself, and making things happen.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><span style="color:#000000">You have:</span></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#000000">8+ years of experience in growth marketing, with a proven track record of scaling customer acquisition, ideally across both B2C and B2B businesses in SaaS, e-learning, or other high-growth industries;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Demonstrable experience scaling paid acquisition campaigns, including managing or scaling advertising budgets of €100,000+ per month;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Strong analytical and problem-solving skills, with the ability to dive into performance data, identify growth opportunities, and translate insights into actionable initiatives;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">A strong understanding of full-funnel marketing, including paid acquisition, CRO, landing page optimization, email marketing, and growth economics such as CAC and LTV;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Strong experience with HubSpot or comparable CRM platforms, including segmentation, automation, lifecycle marketing, attribution, and reporting;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Experience identifying, testing, and scaling new acquisition channels and growth opportunities;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Strong AI proficiency, with experience using ChatGPT and Claude to analyze data, improve workflows, and accelerate execution;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">An understanding of how AI and LLMs are changing customer acquisition, with a forward-thinking approach to emerging marketing channels;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">A proactive, hands-on approach, with the ability to independently lead and execute initiatives while collaborating effectively with the wider team;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills, with a collaborative mindset, openness to feedback, and a hunger to grow;</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Bonus:</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> Experience in event marketing, community-led growth, or account-based marketing (ABM).</span></p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Apply for the job</span></strong></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><span style="color:#000000">Are you excited to become our new Senior Growth Marketing Manager? Then we'd love to hear from you! We are looking to hire for this role as soon as we find an eligible candidate.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">P.S. </span></strong><span style="color:#000000">Research shows that while men apply to jobs when they meet an average of 60% of the criteria, women tend to apply only when they meet 100% of them. So if you think you have what it takes, but don't necessarily meet every single point above, please still apply. We'd love to consider you and see if you could be a great fit.&nbsp;</span></p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/aihr/senior-growth-marketing-manager-rotterdam-462174","tags":["Marketing"],"job_types":["Experienced","fulltime fixed term"],"location":"Rotterdam, Zuid-Holland, Netherlands","created_at":1793946684},{"slug":"senior-php-backend-developer-zoetermeer-85077","company_name":"SHIFTBASE B.V.","title":"Senior PHP Backend Developer","description":"<h3 style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317">About Shiftbase</span></h3><p style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317">At Shiftbase, we build workforce software that helps people get work done. Thousands of teams across Europe rely on our platform every day to plan work, track time, and manage leave, freeing them from unnecessary admin so they can focus on what matters and what sparked their business.</span></p><p style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317">As we continue to grow in customers, usage and product ambition, the demands on our platform grow with us. Our backend needs to scale in </span><strong><span style="color:#121317">quality, reliability and speed of change</span></strong><span style="color:#121317">. That’s why we’re investing heavily in modernising our platform, building a foundation that allows us to move faster, deliver better experiences, and support the next phase of Shiftbase’s growth.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h3 style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317">About the role:</span></h3><p style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317"><br>As a Senior Backend Engineer, you are a key driver of both product delivery and platform modernisation. You work on the core of our backend, improving reliability, performance and scalability, with the explicit goal of turning Shiftbase from a platform people enjoy into a platform they love.</span></p><p style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317">You help evolve a mature monolithic codebase into a more modular, testable and future-proof architecture. By modernising the foundation of the product, you directly enable better user experiences, faster iteration and higher overall product quality.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h3 style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317">What you'll do</span></h3><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="text-align:start;"><strong><span style="color:#121317">Drive technical excellence</span></strong></p><ul class="ak-ul"><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Design and deliver high-quality, scalable solutions for complex features and system components</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Make informed architectural decisions that balance pragmatism with long-term vision</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Set the bar for technical craft through your contributions and code reviews</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Own complex technical initiatives from design through production, breaking them into testable increments</span></p></li></ul><p style="text-align:start;"><strong><span style="color:#121317">Build for reliability and scale</span></strong></p><ul class="ak-ul"><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Define comprehensive testing strategies for complex features, championing quality within the team</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Debug and resolve complex issues across multiple components, improving system observability</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Apply security best practices throughout the development lifecycle</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Contribute to monitoring, alerting and system health improvements</span></p></li></ul><p style="text-align:start;"><strong><span style="color:#121317">Enable team growth</span></strong></p><ul class="ak-ul"><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Mentor engineers with targeted technical guidance and feedback</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Support onboarding and enable a collaborative, knowledge-sharing environment</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Help shape delivery practices and improve team velocity through data-informed decisions</span></p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p> <br> <h3 style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317">What we're looking for</span></h3><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="text-align:start;"><strong><span style="color:#121317">Core technical expertise</span></strong></p><p style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317">You have deep backend engineering experience with complex, high-scale systems. We don't expect expertise in everything listed below. We value engineers who've built depth and breadth through genuine curiosity and a drive to solve real problems. These are examples of competencies that matter in this role:</span></p><ul class="ak-ul"><li><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Modern PHP &amp; architectural patterns</span></strong><span style="color:#121317">: Experience with hexagonal architecture, domain-driven design, or similar patterns that emphasize domain modeling over framework magic. You can build maintainable systems without relying on framework shortcuts.</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">SQL &amp; database design</span></strong><span style="color:#121317">: Comfort writing raw SQL (not just ORM abstractions) and working with complex relational schemas particularly around time-sensitive data like scheduling, timesheets and payroll where integrity and performance are critical.</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Legacy modernisation experience</span></strong><span style="color:#121317">: You've gradually evolved mature systems rather than pursuing big-bang rewrites. You know when to modernize strategically vs. leaving working code untouched, and understand the balance between progress and stability when serving thousands of customers.</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Monolith to services</span></strong><span style="color:#121317">: Experience breaking down monoliths with good judgment about when distribution solves real problems (deployment bottlenecks, team autonomy) vs. when it adds unnecessary complexity.</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Testing in legacy contexts</span></strong><span style="color:#121317">: Practical experience with unit and integration testing, particularly incrementally improving coverage in existing systems.</span></p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="text-align:start;min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h3 style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317">This might be your dream job if…</span></h3><p style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317">✅ You enjoy </span><strong><span style="color:#121317">modernising a mature platform</span></strong><span style="color:#121317"> and turning legacy code into something you’re proud of</span></p><p style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317">✅ You get energy from </span><strong><span style="color:#121317">breaking down a monolith</span></strong><span style="color:#121317"> and shaping a more modular, service-oriented architecture</span></p><p style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317">✅ You care about </span><strong><span style="color:#121317">product quality</span></strong><span style="color:#121317">, not just “shipping code”.</span></p><p style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317">✅ You like improving reliability, performance and developer experience as much as adding new features</span></p><p style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317">✅ You enjoy working closely with product and frontend to make better technical and product decisions</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h3 style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317">This probably isn’t your dream job if…</span></h3><p style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317">⛔️ You only want to work on </span><strong><span style="color:#121317">greenfield projects</span></strong><span style="color:#121317"> and avoid legacy systems altogether</span></p><p style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317">⛔️ You’re uncomfortable refactoring existing code or making incremental improvements</span></p><p style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317">⛔️ You prefer being handed fully-defined solutions rather than helping shape them</span></p><p style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317">⛔️ You’re looking for a role where architecture decisions are already “done”</span></p><p style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317">⛔️ You’d rather optimise locally than care about the </span><strong><span style="color:#121317">end-to-end product experience</span></strong></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><em>Note: Candidates outside the Netherlands will not be considered</em></p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/shiftbase-bv/senior-php-backend-developer-zoetermeer-85077","tags":["IT / Engineering"],"job_types":["Experienced","fulltime fixed term"],"location":"Zoetermeer, Zuid-Holland, Netherlands","created_at":1793946683},{"slug":"wo-stage-onderzoek-milieukosten-mbv-bestaande-afval-en-emissiestatistieken-den-haag-201330","company_name":"Centraal Bureau voor de Statistiek","title":"wo-stage onderzoek milieukosten m.b.v. bestaande afval- en emissiestatistieken","description":"<h4 style="text-align:start;"><strong><span style="font-size:1.2em"><span style="color:#271D6C">wo-</span><span style="color:#0580A1">afstudeerstage/praktijkstage, </span><span style="color:#271D6C">vanaf februari 2027</span></span></strong></h4><p><em><span style="font-size:1.2em">Ben jij die nieuwsgierige onderzoeker die energie krijgt van data, duurzaamheid en nieuwe inzichten?<br>Wil jij een inhoudelijke bijdrage leveren aan de statistieken van het CBS?</span></em></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4><span style="font-size:1.2em"><span style="color:#271D6C">Dit is jouw </span><span style="color:#0580A1">uitdaging</span></span></h4><p><span style="font-size:1.2em">Het kabinet wil dat Nederland in 2050 volledig circulair is. Om te kunnen volgen of we die doelstelling halen, is betrouwbare informatie nodig over onder andere afval en emissies naar water. Het CBS verzamelt en publiceert deze gegevens voor bedrijven. Daarbij maken we vooral gebruik van gegevens uit het elektronisch Milieujaarverslag (e-MJV), aangevuld met enquêtes.</span></p><p><span style="font-size:1.2em">Naast de hoeveelheid afval en wateremissies brengen we ook de milieukosten van bedrijven in kaart, bijvoorbeeld de kosten voor afvalverwerking en voor het lozen van afvalwater. Hiervoor wordt nu een aparte enquête gebruikt. Maar is dat eigenlijk wel nodig?</span></p><p><span style="font-size:1.2em">Tijdens je stage onderzoek je of we de milieukosten voor afval en wateremissies kunnen berekenen met gegevens die al beschikbaar zijn. Je combineert bijvoorbeeld gegevens over de hoeveelheid afval en geloosd water met bestaande indicatoren, zoals gemiddelde kosten per ton afval en sectorspecifieke kosten per kubieke meter geloosd water.</span></p><p><span style="font-size:1.2em">Je gaat onder andere:</span></p><ul><li><p><span style="font-size:1.2em">bestaande data en indicatoren analyseren en beoordelen op bruikbaarheid;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="font-size:1.2em">onderzoeken welke methode het meest geschikt is om de milieukosten te schatten;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="font-size:1.2em">een berekening of model ontwikkelen waarmee de kosten kunnen worden afgeleid;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="font-size:1.2em">de uitkomsten vergelijken met de beschikbare gegevens uit de huidige enquête;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="font-size:1.2em">onderzoeken hoe betrouwbaar en bruikbaar de schattingen zijn;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="font-size:1.2em">je bevindingen vertalen naar een concreet advies voor het CBS.</span></p></li></ul><p><span style="font-size:1.2em">Met jouw onderzoek willen we bepalen of we meer uit bestaande data kunnen halen en minder hoeven uit te vragen bij bedrijven. Als blijkt dat de milieukosten betrouwbaar kunnen worden berekend, kunnen de uitkomsten bovendien worden gebruikt om de bestaande afval- en waterstatistieken te controleren.</span></p><p><span style="font-size:1.2em">In het meest gunstige scenario kan de aparte enquête naar milieukosten gedeeltelijk of helemaal vervallen. Dat betekent minder administratieve lasten voor bedrijven, efficiënter gebruik van beschikbare data en mogelijk betrouwbaardere statistieken.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4><span style="font-size:1.2em"><span style="color:#271D6C">Dit is jouw </span><span style="color:#0580A1">stageplek </span><span style="color:#271D6C">bij CBS </span><span style="color:#0580A1">Den Haag</span></span></h4><p><span style="font-size:1.2em">We verwelkomen je binnen de sector Leefomgeving bij team Milieu. Met 20 gedreven professionals werken we aan milieu gerelateerde statistieken en doen we onderzoek naar actuele thema’s zoals klimaat(verandering) en circulaire economie. We werken nauw samen met andere teams binnen het CBS.</span></p><p><span style="font-size:1.2em">We werken hard aan het continu verbeteren van onze statistieken en de cijfers beschikbaar te stellen voor het publiek. Voorbeelden van recente publicaties uit ons team zijn:</span></p><ul><li><p><a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.cbs.nl/nl-nl/nieuws/2026/02/bedrijven-investeerden-in-2024-minder-in-milieu"><span style="font-size:1.2em">Bedrijven investeerden in 2024 minder in milieu | CBS</span></a></p></li><li><p><a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.cbs.nl/nl-nl/nieuws/2022/50/bijna-2-procent-meer-bedrijfs-en-industrieafval-in-2021"><span style="font-size:1.2em">Bijna 2 procent meer bedrijfs- en industrieafval in 2021 | CBS</span></a></p></li><li><p><a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://opendata.cbs.nl/#/CBS/nl/dataset/82863NED/table?dl=E7F90"><span style="font-size:1.2em">Milieukosten en -investeringen van bedrijven | CBS</span></a></p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4><span style="font-size:1.2em"><span style="color:#271D6C">Dit breng </span><span style="color:#0580A1">jij</span><span style="color:#271D6C"> mee</span></span></h4><p><span style="font-size:1.2em">Je volgt een wo-opleiding milieukunde, economie, technische bestuurskunde, data science of een aanverwante opleiding.</span></p><ul><li><p><span style="font-size:1.2em">Je hebt affiniteit met het onderwerp circulaire economie.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="font-size:1.2em">Je bent&nbsp;analytisch sterk en kunt complexe vraagstukken gestructureerd onderzoeken en vertalen naar heldere inzichten.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="font-size:1.2em">Je kunt goed programmeren in R.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="font-size:1.2em">Je bent sociaal en communicatief vaardig en kunt je ideeën en bevindingen helder overbrengen aan verschillende gesprekspartners.</span></p></li></ul><p><span style="font-size:1.2em">Omdat tijdens de stage alle communicatie – zowel mondeling als schriftelijk – in het Nederlands plaatsvindt, is een goede beheersing van de Nederlandse taal noodzakelijk.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4><span style="font-size:1.2em"><span style="color:#271D6C">Dit kun je van </span><span style="color:#0580A1">ons</span><span style="color:#271D6C"> verwachten</span></span></h4><p><span style="font-size:1.2em">Een fijne leeromgeving waarin je:</span></p><ul><li><p><span style="font-size:1.2em">jouw competenties in kwantitatieve data-analyse versterkt door gebruik te maken van milieustatistieken en economische databronnen;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="font-size:1.2em">jouw onderzoeksvaardigheden aanscherpt op het gebied van de circulaire economie en levenscyclusanalyse;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="font-size:1.2em">jouw programmeervaardigheden in R verder ontwikkelt;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="font-size:1.2em">ervaring opdoet met het interpreteren van verschillende datasets om betrouwbare profielen op te stellen.</span></p></li></ul><p><span style="font-size:1.2em">Voor jouw inzet ontvang je een stagevergoeding van € 800 bruto per maand (op basis van 40 uur per week).</span></p><p><span style="font-size:1.2em">Samen met je stagebegeleider stem je af hoe je hybride kunt werken, met flexibele werktijden en de optie om deels vanuit huis aan jouw stageopdracht te werken.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4><span style="font-size:1.2em"><span style="color:#271D6C">Dit zijn </span><span style="color:#0580A1">onze</span><span style="color:#271D6C"> voorwaarden</span></span></h4><p><span style="font-size:1.2em">Het betreft een stageopdracht en geen werkervaringsplek. Voordat je aan de stage begint verwachten we dat je vanuit de onderwijsinstelling een stagebegeleider hebt, waarmee de stage is afgestemd en concrete leerdoelen zijn afgesproken. <br>Deze stageopdracht is bedoeld voor studenten die momenteel staan ingeschreven bij een onderwijsinstelling; afgestudeerden komen niet in aanmerking.</span></p> <br> <p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/centraal-bureau-voor-de-statistiek/wo-stage-onderzoek-milieukosten-mbv-bestaande-afval-en-emissiestatistieken-den-haag-201330","tags":["Afstudeerstage"],"job_types":["Student college","internship"],"location":"Den Haag, Zuid-Holland, Nederland","created_at":1793946683},{"slug":"wo-stage-woningmarkt-onderzoek-verhuisketens-doorstroom-en-ouderenwoningen-den-haag-321241","company_name":"Centraal Bureau voor de Statistiek","title":"wo-stage woningmarkt onderzoek: verhuisketens, doorstroom en ouderenwoningen","description":"<h4 style="text-align:start;"><strong><span style="font-size:1.2em"><span style="color:#271D6C">wo-</span><span style="color:#0580A1">afstudeerstage, </span><span style="color:#271D6C">vanaf februari 2027</span></span></strong></h4><p><span style="font-size:1.2em">Ben jij die analytische wo-student die nieuwsgierig is naar de doorstroom op de woningmarkt?<br>Krijg je energie van onderzoek doen, werken met data en programmeren in R?<br>Wil je jouw onderzoeksvaardigheden inzetten voor een actueel maatschappelijk vraagstuk?</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4><span style="font-size:1.2em"><span style="color:#271D6C">Dit is jouw </span><span style="color:#0580A1">uitdaging</span></span></h4><p><span style="font-size:1.2em">Verhuisketens geven inzicht in de doorstroom op de woningmarkt en zijn daardoor actueel en relevant. Het CBS heeft een methode ontwikkeld om deze ketens in beeld te brengen. Het dashboard </span><em><a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://dashboards.cbs.nl/verhuisketens/"><span style="font-size:1.2em">Verhuisketens in Nederland</span></a></em><span style="font-size:1.2em"> toont onder meer de gemiddelde lengte van een verhuisketen. Er is echter nog veel ruimte voor verdieping.</span></p><p><span style="font-size:1.2em">Tijdens deze stage kun je afstudeeronderzoek doen naar de rol van ouderenwoningen in de doorstroom op de huizenmarkt. Je kunt daarin op zoek gaan naar antwoorden op de volgende vragen:</span></p><ul><li><p><span style="font-size:1.2em">In hoeverre draagt het bouwen van ouderenwoningen bij aan de doorstroom op de woningmarkt?</span></p></li><li><p><span style="font-size:1.2em">Wat is de invloed van vergrijzing en overlijden van ouderen op de doorstroom en het woningaanbod?</span></p></li></ul><p><span style="font-size:1.2em">Heb je zelf een goede onderzoeksvraag die aansluit bij dit thema, dan is daar ook ruimte voor.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4><span style="font-size:1.2em"><span style="color:#271D6C">Dit is jouw </span><span style="color:#0580A1">stageplek </span><span style="color:#271D6C">bij CBS </span><span style="color:#0580A1">Den Haag</span></span></h4><p><span style="font-size:1.2em"><span style="color:#292A2E">De afdeling Beleidsstatistiek bestaat uit 70 collega’s verdeeld over Den Haag en Heerlen. Er werken onderzoekers en projectleiders met veel verschillende studieachtergronden binnen onze afdeling. Wij stellen cijfers samen die gebruikt worden voor het ontwikkelen, monitoren en verbeteren van beleid, vaak met een thema-overstijgend karakter. We zijn samenwerkingspartner op het gebied van data-gedreven werken bij overheden.</span></span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4><span style="font-size:1.2em"><span style="color:#271D6C">Dit breng </span><span style="color:#0580A1">jij</span><span style="color:#271D6C"> mee</span></span></h4><p><span style="font-size:1.2em">Je bent bijna klaar met jouw wo master-opleiding in de sociale wetenschappen, demografie, ruimtelijke ordening of een aanverwante opleiding en zoekt een afstudeerstage om je opleiding succesvol af te ronden.</span></p><p><span style="font-size:1.2em">Daarnaast:</span></p><ul><li><p><span style="font-size:1.2em">heb je (enige) ervaring met programmeren in R;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="font-size:1.2em">kun je zelfstandig onderzoek uitvoeren en uitkomsten analyseren;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="font-size:1.2em">weet je hoe je met verschillende methoden en technieken onderzoek doet.</span></p></li></ul><p><span style="font-size:1.2em">Kernwoorden die jou omschrijven zijn enthousiast, proactief en analytisch.</span></p><p><span style="font-size:1.2em">Omdat alle communicatie tijdens de stage – zowel mondeling als schriftelijk – in het Nederlands plaatsvindt, is een goede beheersing van de Nederlandse taal noodzakelijk.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4><span style="font-size:1.2em"><span style="color:#271D6C">Dit kun je van </span><span style="color:#0580A1">ons</span><span style="color:#271D6C"> verwachten</span></span></h4><p><span style="font-size:1.2em">Een fijne leeromgeving waarin je:</span></p><ul><li><p><span style="font-size:1.2em">jouw vakkennis vergroot en werkervaring opdoet;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="font-size:1.2em">programmeervaardigheden toepast in de praktijk;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="font-size:1.2em">leert werken met CBS-data.<br></span></p></li></ul><p><span style="font-size:1.2em">Voor jouw inzet ontvang je een stagevergoeding van € 800 bruto per maand (op basis van 40 uur per week).</span></p><p><span style="font-size:1.2em">Samen met je stagebegeleider stem je af hoe je hybride kunt werken, met flexibele werktijden en de optie om deels vanuit huis aan jouw stageopdracht te werken.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4><span style="font-size:1.2em"><span style="color:#271D6C">Dit zijn </span><span style="color:#0580A1">onze</span><span style="color:#271D6C"> voorwaarden</span></span></h4><p><span style="font-size:1.2em">Het betreft een stageopdracht en geen werkervaringsplek. Voordat je aan de stage begint verwachten we dat je vanuit de onderwijsinstelling een stagebegeleider hebt, waarmee de stage is afgestemd en concrete leerdoelen zijn afgesproken. <br>Deze stageopdracht is bedoeld voor studenten die momenteel staan ingeschreven bij een onderwijsinstelling; afgestudeerden komen niet in aanmerking.</span></p> <br> <p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/centraal-bureau-voor-de-statistiek/wo-stage-woningmarkt-onderzoek-verhuisketens-doorstroom-en-ouderenwoningen-den-haag-321241","tags":["Afstudeerstage"],"job_types":["Student college","internship"],"location":"Den Haag, Zuid-Holland, Nederland","created_at":1793946683},{"slug":"hbo-stage-social-media-content-creatie-den-haag-116363","company_name":"Centraal Bureau voor de Statistiek","title":"hbo-stage Social Media & Content Creatie","description":"<h4 style="text-align:start;"><strong><span style="font-size:1.2em"><span style="color:#271D6C">hbo-</span><span style="color:#0580A1">praktijkstage, </span><span style="color:#271D6C">vanaf februari 2027</span></span></strong></h4><p><em><span style="font-size:1.2em">Ben jij creatief, nieuwsgierig en krijg je energie van social media die écht impact maakt?<br>Grijp de kans om jouw ideeën tot leven te brengen en zichtbaar te maken voor een groot publiek.</span></em></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4><span style="font-size:1.2em"><span style="color:#271D6C">Dit is jouw </span><span style="color:#0580A1">uitdaging</span></span></h4><p><span style="font-size:1.2em">Tijdens jouw stage bij het CBS duik je in de wereld van social media en ga je a