<p>If you have the passion to dig deeper, the desire to challenge convention, and the curiosity to build something better, Sysdig is the right place for you.</p>
<div>&nbsp;</div><br><strong>What you will do:</strong><br>
<li style="list-style-type: revert;">Reporting to our SVP Sales, EMEA &amp; APJ&nbsp;you will implement sales plans for your assigned territory by forecasting and exceeding quota</li>
<li style="list-style-type: revert;">Through a combination of inbound and outbound leads, you will manage a high-velocity, SaaS funnel</li>
