&lt;li&gt;Own the internal audit programme, track nonconformities and corrective actions, and coordinate certification and surveillance audits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare the annual management review and report on data protection risks, audit findings, and improvement priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Train teams on data protection and quality management requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the ISB to align overlapping requirements while maintaining clear responsibilities and independence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel occasionally to our offices in Berlin, Dresden, and Hamburg, as well as to other workshop locations across Germany, to facilitate workshops, training sessions, and audits.&lt;/li&gt;
