&lt;li&gt;Experience with merchant or partner communications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building landing pages using a website content management system&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Seismic or similar sales enablement platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
