hy.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Prioritise opportunities with clear recommendations on the customer problem, expected impact and how we will measure success.</p></li></ul><h3>Hands-on experimentation and improvement</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Propose and run tests with international commercial and platform teams, taking opportunities from an initial hypothesis through to execution, measurement and a decision on what happens next.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Test changes to our proposition, messaging and customer experience, from how we explain our value to how customers search, book and manage their holiday.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Use results to refine our approach, stop ideas that do not work and build evidence for wider investment in those that do.</p></li></ul><h3>A platform that scales internationally</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Translate international customer needs and market opportunities into clear proposition and experience requirements for product, design and engineering teams.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work with platform teams to influence priorities and shape solutions that address local needs while building capabilities we can reuse across markets.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Identify where our platform limits international growth, including gaps in localisation, content, payment options, trust and the post-booking experience, and work with teams to test and address them.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Bring evidence from current markets into future market planning, helping teams understand what can scale, what needs to adapt and what we should validate before launch.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Your skillset:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You have significant experience in product marketing, proposition develo