"min-height:1.5em">Jellyfish is a global digital marketing agency; a unique fusion of tech enthusiasts, creative minds, and media and data experts all united to empower our clients along their digital journey. Our commitment to embracing diverse perspectives fuels our innovation and strategies that challenge the status quo, reinvent media activation, and craft influential stories for our global clients and their customers. Join us in shaping a future where business growth and personal fulfilment go hand in hand.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1><strong>Job Description</strong></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">The Integrated Media Senior Director is a senior leadership role accountable for the effective delivery, performance, and integration of all paid media activities across an assigned account or portfolio of accounts. Acting as the operational and strategic lead for media investment, this role ensures that media budgets are planned, deployed, optimized, and measured effectively to drive client growth and business outcomes.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">The Integrated Media Senior Director oversees the full spectrum of paid media activity, including Search, Social, Programmatic, Direct Buys, Retail Media, Retail Operations, Media Strategy, and Investment Analytics. The role is responsible for ensuring strategic alignment, investment effectiveness, operational excellence, and cross-channel collaboration across the client portfolio.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">While channel specialists remain directly managed within their respective functions, they maintain a dotted-line relationship with the Integrated Media Senior Director to support client-centric accountability and integrated media delivery.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h1><strong>Key Responsibilities</strong></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h3>Leadership &amp; Governance</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Serve as the primary point of accountability for paid media delivery and performance across assigned accounts.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Translate client business objectives into integrated, cross-channel media strategies.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Establish clear performance goals, KPIs, and measurement frameworks to evaluate media effectiveness.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Drive operational excellence through consistent implementation of processes, infrastructure, workflows, pacing disciplines, and optimization routines.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ensure alignment and coordination across all paid media functions to deliver a seamless client experience.</p></li></ul><h3>Strategic Investment &amp; Planning</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partner with Strategy teams to define roles, responsibilities, and planning approaches based on client needs and organizational structure.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lead cross-channel media planning and investment allocation to maximize business outcomes.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Collaborate with Client Teams to identify optimization opportunities and innovative media solutions.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Oversee forecasting, budget pacing, and performance reporting across assigned accounts.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partner with Investment Analytics to improve the adoption and effectiveness of reporting and pacing solutions.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Champion the use of data, automation, and platform capabilities to maximize return on investment and efficiency.</p></li></ul><h3>Cross-Functional Integration</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Foster collaboration and alignment across all relevant media and client-facing teams.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partner with Channel Leads to ensure best practices, standards, and operational consistency are implemented across accounts.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Facilitate cross-channel planning, learning, and knowledge-sharing initiatives.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Promote continuous capability development and client education on media investment and performance.</p></li></ul><h3>Client &amp; Partner Leadership</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Act as a senior client contact for media investment, planning, and performance discussions.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build trusted relationships with clients and key partners.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Translate complex media performance data into actionable business recommendations.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Proactively identify opportunities to improve media effectiveness and client outcomes.</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h1>Success Measures</h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">The success of the Integrated Media Senior Director will be evaluated against the following key performance indicators:</p><h3>Performance Efficiency</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Achieve or exceed client spend and performance targets.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ensure budget pacing and optimization activities align with client objectives and agreed benchmarks.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Measured through quarterly and annual business reviews.</p></li></ul><h3>Client Satisfaction &amp; Retention</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Achieve a client Net Promoter Score (NPS) of 9 or higher within the first year.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Drive proactive performance insights and continuous improvement in client communications.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Assessed through semi-annual client feedback and satisfaction surveys.</p></li></ul><h3>Operational Excellence</h3><ul s