 to solving mobile challenges!<br></span></p><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Key aspects of the role include:</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Technical Excellence &amp; Delivery: </span></strong><span style="color:#121317">Designing and delivering end-to-end features and small subsystems; optimising app performance, accessibility, and responsiveness; and being accountable for successful delivery of features.</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Communication &amp; Stakeholder Management:</span></strong><span style="color:#121317"> Explaining technical trade-offs in plain language; and presenting demos confidently to clients and stakeholders to shape tactical direction.</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Leadership &amp; Team Collaboration: </span></strong><span style="color:#121317">Leading delivery of specific features or workstreams; and mentoring junior colleagues in both craft and process.</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Culture &amp; Community of Practice: </span></strong><span style="color:#121317">Regularly mentoring others across the practice; and representing Waracle in interviews and recruitment panels.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Participating in ad-hoc duties from time to time as required by management.</span></p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><em><span style="color:#121317">Research shows that underrepresented groups tend to only apply for roles that they believe they meet 100% of the criteria for. At Waracle, we want to buck that trend! We hire for passion, potential and mindset as much as credentials. If you think you'd be incredible in the role, then apply - even if you don't think you tick every box.</span></em></p> <br> <p><strong><span style="color:#121317">What you'll bring:</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Core Language &amp; Framework Expertise: </span></strong><spa