rs in delivering high-quality work.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">The role spans three key areas of responsibility:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Technical leadership</strong> — coding, pair programming, peer reviews, and driving software and architecture design.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>People management</strong> — running 1:1s, supporting career progression, and ensuring a strong feedback loop.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Product collaboration</strong> — working closely with product and design to shape scope, prioritise effectively, and align on outcomes.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em">We're building both the system and the team that will take us to the next stage — and you'll have real influence on how we scale, structure, and evolve our technology.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What You’ll Be Doing</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Lead and mentor</strong> a globally distributed team of engineers, fostering a high-performance, inclusive, and collaborative culture.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Set the bar for technical excellence</strong>, promoting best practices across architecture, CI/CD, testing, and code quality.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Drive a DevOps mindset</strong> — engineers own what they build, from design to deployment and beyond.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Architect and deliver</strong> scalable, maintainable systems and features with measurable impact on learners.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Collaborate with AI specialists</strong> to integrate adaptive, personalized learning into our platform.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Partner cross-functionally</strong> with product, design, and data to shape roadmap, scope work, and align on outcomes.</p></li><li><p style="min-h