&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/sonymusicentertainment/cheffe-de-projet-strategie-communication-corporate-b-stage-europe-paris-215550","tags":["SME France"],"job_types":[],"location":"Europe, Paris","created_at":1793926523},{"slug":"commercial-counsel-fellowship-hybrid-176104","company_name":"Runway","title":"Commercial Counsel Fellowship","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em">We are building AI to simulate the world through merging art and science.<br /><br />We believe that world models are at the frontier of progress in artificial intelligence. Language models alone won’t solve the world’s hardest problems – robotics, disease, scientific discovery. Real progress requires models that experience the world and learn from their mistakes, the same way that humans do. And this kind of trial and error can be massively accelerated when done in simulation, rather than in the real world.<br /><br />World models offer the most clear path to general-purpose simulation, changing how stories are told, how scientific progress is made and how the next frontiers of humanity are reached.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Our team consists of creative, open minded, caring and ambitious people who are determined to change the world. We aspire to continuously build impossible things and our ability to do so relies on building an incredible team. If you are driven to do the same, we'd love to hear from you.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">*Titles posted to our careers page are updated regularly to best advertise the role and expected seniority, but internally we have a flat titling system with two types of titles: one for individual contributors and one for people managers.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>About the role</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>Preferable to have someone near one of our offices in NYC or San Francisco.</em></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Runway’s Commercial Counsel Fellowship is an intensive, full-time, 1 year venture dedicated to fostering high caliber early-career lawyers who want to build real in-house experience at a fast-moving AI company. You'll work directly alongside our Commercial Counsel team on live deals from your first weeks, with hands-on training and mentorship along the way.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">No prior commercial or in-house experience is required. We care more about sharp judgment, strong writing, and a fast learning curve than a specific background. Comfort working in a highly technical, rapidly evolving area of the law is a must. Whether you're coming from a law firm, a clerkship, or straight out of law school, we'll teach you how to negotiate commercial agreements and partner with the business.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h2><strong>What you'll do</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Draft, review, and negotiate Runway's commercial agreements, including B2B SaaS customer contracts for our generative AI platform and APIs, DPAs, partnership agreements, and vendor agreements, taking on more complex deals as you ramp</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partner with the sales team with fast, practical answers that help close deals</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Help scale and automate our commercial processes and tools, including templates, playbooks, contract review automation, and our legal tech stack</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Learn the technical side of our generative AI products inside and out, so your advice to the business is grounded in how they work</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Research and track technical, legal, and policy developments in generative AI, and share what matters with the team</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Depending on your interests, contribute to projects across the broader legal team, such as privacy, IP, product counseling, or compliance</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h2><strong>What you'll get</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Hands-on training in commercial contracting and in-house practice, with real ownership from early on</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Mentorship from experienced in-house lawyers, with regular feedback on your work</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Exposure to cross-functional teams across sales, partnerships, product, and marketing, and to the Runway Executive Team</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A front-row seat to the legal questions shaping generative AI video</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Potential to convert to a full-time role at the end of the fellowship, in Commercial Counsel or another area of the legal team</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h2><strong>What you'll need</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A J.D. plus admission in good standing with at least one state bar (or sitting for the bar before the fellowship starts)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">0–3 years of legal experience, for example at a law firm, in a clerkship, in an in-house or government role</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A strong academic record and excellent legal writing and analytical skills</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Bias for action and a willingness to take ownership</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Growth mindset and an eagerness to learn quickly, take feedback, and improve how things get done</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Clear, practical communication with non-lawyers</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Operational mindset</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Excitement about generative AI and motivation to continuously learn more about the legal landscape governing a new and exciting industry</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Nice to have</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Exposure to technology transactions, SaaS agreements, IP, or data privacy, through practice, coursework, a clinic, or a summer associate role</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience using AI tools in your own legal work</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Familiarity with how AI or software products are built</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>FAQs</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Are there specific fellowship start dates or can I start anytime?</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">We do not currently have specific start dates. Start dates can be year round.</p></li></ul></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">I am 10 years out of law school. Can I still apply for the fellowship?</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">The fellowship is meant for early-career lawyers (first 3 years of legal practice). However, lots of lawyers take different, non-traditional paths. If you are an experienced lawyer who is early in your commercial counsel career, you are still welcome to apply. Explain your career transition and interest in commercial legal work in your application.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Runway strives to recruit and retain exceptional talent from diverse backgrounds while ensuring pay equity for our team. Our salary ranges are based on competitive market rates for our size, stage and industry, and salary is just one part of the overall compensation package we provide.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">There are many factors that go into salary determinations, including relevant experience, skill level and qualifications assessed during the interview process, and maintaining internal equity with peers on the team. The range shared below is a general expectation for the function as posted, but we are also open to considering candidates who may be more or less experienced than outlined in the job description. In this case, we will communicate any updates in the expected salary range.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lastly, the provided range is the expected salary for candidates in the U.S. Outside of those regions, there may be a change in the range, which again, will be communicated to candidates.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h3><strong>Working at Runway</strong></h3><p style="min-height:1.5em"><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kwmj4ato2kw&amp;ab_channel=Runway"><strong>Great things come from great teams.</strong></a><strong> We’d love to hear from you.</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We’re committed to creating a space where our employees can bring their full selves to work and have equal opportunity to succeed. So regardless of race, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, religion, origin, ability, age, veteran status, if joining this mission speaks to you, we encourage you to apply.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><u>More about Runway</u></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://runwayml.com/world-simulator.html">Universal World Simulator</a></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://runwayml.com/research/introducing-runway-gwm-1">GWM-1</a></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://runwayml.com/research/introducing-runway-gen-4.5">Gen-4.5</a></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://runwayml.com/research/introducing-general-world-models">General World Models</a></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://runwayml.com/research/introducing-runway-gwm-1#robotics-section">Robotics SDK</a></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://runwayml.com/research/introducing-runway-gwm-1#avatars-section">Conversational Real-time Agents</a></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://runwayml.com/studios">Runway Studios</a></p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em">We're excited to be recognized as a best place to work: </p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://www.crainsnewyork.com/awards/best-places-work-2023">Crain's</a> | <a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://www.inhersight.com/companies/best/city/new-york-city-ny">InHerSight</a> | <a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://builtin.com/awards/new-york-city/2024/best-places-to-work">BuiltIn NYC</a> | <a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://www.inc.com/best-workplaces/2024">INC</a></p><hr><p>Compensation: $140K – $190K</p><ul><li> • $140K – $190K</li></ul><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/runway/commercial-counsel-fellowship-hybrid-176104","tags":["Legal"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Hybrid","created_at":1793925612},{"slug":"vo2-force-product-owner-clienteling-paris-france-378308","company_name":"VO2 Group","title":"[VO2 Force] - Product Owner Clienteling","description":"<div>🌟 <strong>VO2 GROUP : Leader français indépendant en conseil Tech et Digital<br><br></strong>Entre conseil stratégique et réalisation technologique, nous cultivons un esprit "boutique" : de l'excellence, de l'humain et une forte culture de l'innovation.<br><br>Nous sommes présents à Paris, Montréal, Shanghai, New York et Genève, avec plus de 800 consultants.<br><br>🌍 Leader mondial de l'expérience client et corporate<br><br>Nous collaborons avec les marques les plus emblématiques pour assurer leur succès :<br><br>✔️ De la stratégie et l'innovation<br><br>✔️ À l'exécution à grande échelle, grâce à notre expertise en business, tech, data et IA 🤖✨<br><br>🏆 Reconnaissances &amp; Leadership<br><br>Leader en innovation et croissance 2025 (Les Echos Business Magazine)<br><br>Acteur multi-tech et partenaire Premium Salesforce<br><br>🌿 Champion d'une "Tech Responsable et Durable"<br><br>Créé avec la parité hommes-femmes, défendant l’égalité grâce à une équipe de direction engagée 🌟<br><br>45 % de femmes au sein de nos équipes<br><br>Campagne primée TopCom en 2024<br><br>📜 Certifications et Prix<br><br>Salesforce Impact Partner 2024<br><br>Cybervadis 2025<br><br>Entreprise à impact de l'année 2024 par Choose My Company<br><br>🚀VO2 GROUP: The Bright Side of Tech 🌈<br><br>___________________________________________________________________</div>
<div>&nbsp;</div>
<div>&nbsp;</div>
<div>
<h4 data-path-to-node="2">📋 Description du poste&nbsp;</h4>
<p data-pm-slice="1 1 []">En tant que <strong>Product Owner Clienteling</strong>, vous interviendrez auprès d'une grande Maison de luxe internationale sur l'évolution d'une application reposant sur l'écosystème <strong>Salesforce</strong>.</p>
<p>Véritable interface entre les équipes métier et techniques, vous accompagnerez la division dans la conception et l'amélioration de ses outils de clienteling, dans un environnement agile et international.</p>
<h3>&nbsp;</h3>
<h4 data-path-to-node="7">🎯 Responsabilités &amp; Tâches clés</h4>
<p data-pm-slice="1 3 []">Votre quotidien s'articulera autour de quatre grands piliers :</p>
<p><strong>1. Recueil des besoins &amp; Recommandations Produit</strong></p>
<ul data-spread="false">
<li>
<p>Recueillir, analyser et challenger les besoins des équipes métier Retail et Digital.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Identifier les axes d'amélioration des parcours clients et des outils de clienteling.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Proposer des solutions fonctionnelles adaptées aux enjeux métier et aux usages en boutique.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>2. Conception fonctionnelle &amp; Gestion du Backlog</strong></p>
<ul data-spread="false">
<li>
<p>Rédiger les spécifications fonctionnelles, <em>User Stories</em> et critères d'acceptation.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Formaliser les parcours utilisateurs, règles de gestion et besoins d'intégration entre les outils.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Alimenter, prioriser et affiner le backlog en collaboration avec l'Application Manager.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Contribuer à la conception des maquettes et prototypes.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>3. Suivi des développements &amp; Méthodologie Agile</strong></p>
<ul data-spread="false">
<li>
<p>Assurer l'interface fonctionnelle entre les équipes métier et les développeurs iOS et Salesforce.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Participer aux cérémonies Agile (<em>Daily, Sprint Planning, Refinement, Sprint Review</em>).</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Suivre l'avancement des développements et accompagner les arbitrages fonctionnels.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>4. Recette, Déploiement &amp; Accompagnement du changement</strong></p>
<ul data-spread="false">
<li>
<p>Préparer et participer aux phases de recette fonctionnelle et aux tests utilisateurs (UAT).</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Suivre les anomalies et valider la conformité des fonctionnalités livrées.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Accompagner les déploiements internationaux et l'adoption des nouvelles fonctionnalités.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Produire les supports utilisateurs et assurer la communication auprès des équipes métier.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<div>&nbsp;</div>
<h4 data-path-to-node="18">👤 Profil recherché</h4>
</div>
<div>
<p data-pm-slice="1 3 []">Pour réussir sur ce poste, nous recherchons un profil doté d'une <strong>forte expertise fonctionnelle, d'une bonne connaissance du luxe et du clienteling</strong>, ainsi que d'une excellente capacité à interagir avec les équipes métier.</p>
<ul data-spread="false">
<li>
<p><strong>Formation &amp; Expérience :</strong> Vous justifiez idéalement de <strong>3&nbsp;à 5 ans d'expérience</strong> en tant que Business Analyst, Proxy Product Owner ou Product Owner sur des projets digitaux.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Expertise Métier :</strong> Vous possédez une expérience dans le <strong>secteur du luxe</strong> et une bonne maîtrise des enjeux de <strong>clienteling, CRM, Retail et omnicanalité</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Compétences Fonctionnelles :</strong> Vous maîtrisez le recueil des besoins, la rédaction de spécifications fonctionnelles, les User Stories et la gestion de backlog. Une connaissance de <strong>Salesforce</strong> est appréciée.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Gestion de projet &amp; Agilité :</strong> Vous évoluez avec aisance dans un environnement <strong>Agile/Scrum</strong> et maîtrisez <strong>Jira</strong>. Une expérience sur des applications mobiles ou des projets internationaux constitue un atout.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Soft Skills :</strong> Autonome, diplomate et force de proposition, vous êtes reconnu(e) pour votre capacité d'analyse, votre sens du service et votre aisance dans la communication avec des interlocuteurs métier exigeants.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Langues :</strong> <strong>Anglais courant indispensable</strong>, à l'oral comme à l'écrit, dans un environnement international.</p>
