i-agents-assistant-paris-307546","company_name":"Dashlane","title":"Staff Product Manager, AI Agents & Assistant","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Dashlane&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left: 0.0in;&quot;&gt;Dashlane’s mission is to deliver the credential security every business and employee needs to thrive. Millions of consumers, and over 25,000 brands worldwide, such as Michelin, Air France, and Forrester, trust Dashlane for industry-leading innovations, patented zero-knowledge security, and an unmatched user experience. Founded in Paris, Dashlane has since established offices in New York and Lisbon, and has grown to more than 300 Dashlaners globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left: 0.0in;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for people who actively use AI tools to drive efficiency, creativity, and impact in their work. At Dashlane, we drive innovation and value learning, strive for excellence in everything we do, and thrive as one team. Learn more about&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://lifeatdashlane.com/&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;link&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;underline&quot;&gt;life at Dashlane&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, including &lt;a href=&quot;https://lifeatdashlane.com/how-we-work&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;link&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;underline&quot;&gt;how we work&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://lifeatdashlane.com/how-we-hire&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;link&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;underline&quot;&gt;how we hire&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, and the &lt;a href=&quot;https://lifeatdashlane.com/benefits-dashlane&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;link&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;underline&quot;&gt;benefits of being a Dashlaner&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left: 0.0in;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;_3iDTPbvLZJ renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-level=&quot;2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;About-the-role&quot; data-local-id=&quot;19912f4e57bc&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5090&quot;&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5106&quot; data-local-id=&quot;aad315eed8c9&quot;&gt;As our Staff Product Manager for Agentic Capabilities, you will own the vision, strategy and roadmap for how Dashlane becomes an interface for AI agents and assistants for consumers and businesses. Success means people hand real, valuable tasks to agents through Dashlane and keep doing it, and companies trust it enough to let their teams do the same.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5461&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8eccdecf657e&quot;&gt;You will own the product alongside senior engineers as a Staff-level individual contributor in a 0-to-1 role where standards are still unsettled. We are looking for strong familiarity with the modern AI landscape, including LLMs, assistants and agentic workflows, and sound judgment about what agents can and cannot be trusted with.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5797&quot; data-local-id=&quot;34d4eaf63e5f&quot;&gt;At Dashlane, we embrace a hybrid culture that combines the best of both worlds: the creativity and energy of in-person collaboration with the flexibility of remote work. Our model is designed to strengthen team connections while supporting individual productivity and work-life balance. To maximize collaboration, we come together in the office on Mondays, Tuesdays, and Thursdays, while Wednesdays and Fridays offer more flexibility for focused work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;_3iDTPbvLZJ renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-level=&quot;2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 data-local-id=&quot;77482dc82bc5&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6251&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;Key-Responsibilities&quot; data-local-id=&quot;77482dc82bc5&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6251&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0a99785c0c6d&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6275&quot; data-local-id=&quot;59efdc1c591a&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Set the direction.&lt;/strong&gt; Form and defend a point of view on how agents and assistants should act with what Dashlane protects, for consumers and businesses, and turn it into a strategy, positioning, and multi-year plan that leadership will back.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6517&quot; data-local-id=&quot;bce92e95e7ad&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Read the market and judge readiness.&lt;/strong&gt; Keep a living view of how agent makers, assistants, browsers, identity vendors and password managers are moving. Assess how ready emerging pieces such as passkeys for agents and agent sign-in standards are, and set the triggers for acting on each.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6805&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d38d610e5440&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Own the evidence.&lt;/strong&gt; Run discovery on the jobs people hand to agents at home and at work. Establish who hands over real tasks and what holds them back, so your bets follow demand, not hype.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6995&quot; data-local-id=&quot;35ff28428296&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Connect consumer and business. &lt;/strong&gt;Treat both as a connected problem. Turn what we learn from individuals handing tasks to agents into the visibility and controls that IT and Security teams need to govern agent access at work. Flag when a decision for one audience affects the other.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7278&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c49f9dbddf57&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Own the trust commitment.&lt;/strong&gt; Define what Dashlane promises about what an agent or model can see and do, and hold every product decision and release to that promise. Turn what agents can and cannot be trusted with into a set of durable product primitives, such as limits, approvals, records and revocation, that stay valid as agents change.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7618&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e353f510e173&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Shape our place in the ecosystem.&lt;/strong&gt; Decide which agent makers and platforms we invest in and on what terms. Build the relationships and technical case that make Dashlane an easy yes for them, and for the services agents log in to. Lead Dashlane’s input to the standards that govern how agents sign in and act on someone’s behalf, so our positions reflect real customer needs and our product direction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;8021&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6374e14b8ed4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Own the numbers.&lt;/strong&gt; Set baselines and targets for adoption, repeat use and trust, including time to a first approved agent login, how long people take to decide on an agent’s request, and how often failures are recovered without the person starting over. Be accountable for them to leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;8315&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a51e9c74593c&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Align the organization.&lt;/strong&gt; Bring Design, Engineering, Security, Legal, Sales &amp;amp; Marketing towards one plan, establish the operating rhythm and decision framework for the team, and settle ownership where it is unclear.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;8533&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3c94388c7732&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;In your first year:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a48727a5-e11e-4625-8e99-b0eab5b94e31&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;8556&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f39e777e5f61&quot;&gt;By 90 days, the team&#39;s early engineering work has become a shared view of the problem, a trust model that Security and Architecture back, and proposed targets for what &quot;working&quot; means. You have shared a point of view on the category with Dashlane leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;8818&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ee184f00ef02&quot;&gt;By 6 months, real people are experiencing agentic value through Dashlane, engagement is recurring, and you know who gets the most value first.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;8964&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7ac70962fff5&quot;&gt;By 12 months, people keep using it and it shows in who chooses and stays on our plans. A version for companies has a clear first slice, and you have a view on where to go next. You have a vision and roadmap for agents and assistants across B2B and B2C that leadership has backed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;_3iDTPbvLZJ renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-level=&quot;2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;Requirements&quot; data-local-id=&quot;23415a77a654&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9248&quot;&gt;Requirements&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;44de67de-87ee-4e76-87ba-6b2761ae348e&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9264&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4f5ff97b8778&quot;&gt;8+ years in product management, including ownership of an authentication, security, identity or permissions-heavy product, and at least one product you took from zero to market with measurable success (adoption, revenue or retention) in a market that was still emerging.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9538&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e526e309255b&quot;&gt;Enough technical fluency (OAuth, passkeys, sessions, browser extensions) to follow a token-flow discussion with engineers and ask where it breaks. You don&#39;t need to write code but you must be comfortable with speaking the language of engineering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9788&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1ed77682bdbd&quot;&gt;Strong familiarity with the modern AI landscape, including LLMs, assistants and agentic workflows. The ability to reason about what AI can and cannot do through a product and customer lens, with working knowledge of how agents operate: tool use and standard tool interfaces, browser-driving agents, how context is kept or lost, and where they can be tricked.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;10150&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7b7902c20689&quot;&gt;A track record of reading a fast-moving market and turning its signals into a strategy that leadership acted on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;10266&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fc0d9a0f1c89&quot;&gt;Experience running 0-to-1 discovery with small samples and incomplete information, defining success as customer outcomes rather than shipped features.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;10420&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8f95c8e51624&quot;&gt;AI-native ways of working: you build working prototypes with AI, run discovery synthesis through it, chain agents into your own workflow, and can show concretely how it has changed how you “do product”.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;10626&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9d0a725767a6&quot;&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills in English: crisp problem statements, clear 1-pagers, compelling roadmap rationale, and external narratives that shape how a category is understood.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;_3iDTPbvLZJ renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-level=&quot;2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;We&#39;re-Also-Looking-For&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3edbf234c2c3&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;10896&quot;&gt;We&#39;re Also Looking For&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7a985215-8ce8-4df7-b0a8-f5853f6e04a7&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;10922&quot; data-local-id=&quot;93f30a5d2bd6&quot;&gt;Systems thinking and platform experience. You think in systems and have shipped a platform, API, integration product or partner ecosystem that other software relies on, with outcomes you can describe: the baseline, what changed, what you cut.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;11168&quot; data-local-id=&quot;adb3c96f00e4&quot;&gt;Consumer and business experience. Experience with products that serve both individuals and businesses, and the instinct to flag early how a decision in one ripples into the other.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;11351&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5dee42f5b07d&quot;&gt;Comfort with ambiguity. You will join a team whose engineers have already started scouting ahead, and you favor action over perfection, deciding with incomplete information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;11528&quot; data-local-id=&quot;05504f51dc63&quot;&gt;A collaborative spirit and low ego. As comfortable deferring to others&#39; expertise as you are asserting your own point of view.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;11658&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7f9668bbf5e4&quot;&gt;Intellectual honesty. You share results transparently, learn openly from failures, and write down the evidence that would make you move earlier, later or not at all.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;11827&quot; data-local-id=&quot;2bfda6189693&quot;&gt;Security standard for AI. You have a threat-model instinct (prompt injection, phishing, malicious extensions, what a compromised agent could still do) and hold AI to the same standard as security: human accountability at every consequential decision, and evaluation before anything ships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity, Inclusion and Belonging at Dashlane:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a truly international company—founded in France and &lt;span style=&quot;color: #172b4d;&quot;&gt;distributed across&lt;/span&gt; France, US and Portugal—Dashlane thrives off diverse perspectives. We value all aspects of diversity: gender identity, sexual orientation, ability, ethnic origin, social background, age, lifestyle, and more. We are committed to hiring a diverse community and fostering a culture where everyone is heard and belongs. See more about this &lt;a href=&quot;https://lifeatdashlane.com/diversity&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;inline-comment-marker&quot; data-ref=&quot;d1c12b7e-4df1-44c5-a10f-2644909c66db&quot;&gt;Your interview experience:&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To know what to expect once you’ve sent your application, &lt;a href=&quot;https://lifeatdashlane.com/how-we-hire&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;read about how we interview and hire at Dashlane&lt;/a&gt;. Feel free to browse our blog to find more information about our product and how we work.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/dashlane/staff-product-manager-ai-agents-assistant-paris-307546","tags":["Product"],"job_types":[],"location":"Paris","created_at":1793915729},{"slug":"senior-sales-engineer-france-272217","company_name":"Horizon3Ai","title":"Senior Sales Engineer, France","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Get to Know Us</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Horizon3 is a fast-growing, remote cybersecurity company dedicated to the mission of enabling organizations to proactively find and fix and verify exploitable attack vectors before criminals exploit them. Our flagship product, the NodeZeroTM platform, delivers production-safe autonomous pentests and other key assessment operations that scale across the largest internal, external, cloud, and hybrid cloud environments. NodeZero has been adopted by organizations of all sizes, from small educational institutions to government agencies and Global 100 enterprises. It is used by ITOps/SecOps teams, consulting pentesters, and MSSPs and MSPs. </p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We are a fusion of former U.S. Special Operations cyber operators, startup engineers, and formerly frustrated cybersecurity practitioners. We're committed to helping solve our common security problems: ineffective security tools, false positives resulting in alert fatigue, blind spots, "checkbox” security culture, cybersecurity skills shortage, and the long lead time and expense of hiring outside consultants. Collectively, we are a team of learn it alls, committed to a culture of respect, collaboration, ownership, and results.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What You’ll Do</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Horizon3 is committed to defending businesses from the ever-growing threat landscape. Our advanced solutions and expert team provide unparalleled security for our clients. We are looking for a passionate Sales Engineer/Solutions Architect to join our team and help prospects and clients understand the true value and capabilities of our products and services.</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Technical expertise - Demonstrate deep knowledge of our cybersecurity products and services, assisting the sales team in presenting and position them to prospects and clients</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Customer engagement - Meet with potential customers to understand their cybersecurity needs, challenges, and infrastructure, ensuring that our solutions are the perfect fit for them</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Product demonstrations - Provide live demos and proof of concepts for our cybersecurity solutions, tailoring each demo to the specific needs and concerns of the potential customer</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Solution development - Will work closely with the sales and product teams to design and refine our solutions based on customer needs</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Technical training - train the sales team on the technical aspects of our products to enhance their ability to sell more effectively</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Feedback loop - relay feedback from the field to our product and engineering teams, contributing to the ongoing improvement of our product</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">RFP/RFI assistance - Assist in answering technical sections of RFPs and RFIs</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Post-sales support - On rare occasions, assist in post-sales processes to ensure the smooth implementation and satisfaction of our customers</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What You’ll Bring</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">5+ years of experience as a Pre-Sales Engineer/Solutions Architect in the cybersecurity domain</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong understanding of cyber threats, risk management, and cybersecurity solutions.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Excellent verbal and written communication skills</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Demonstrated ability to simplify complex technical topics for a non-technical audience</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Highly collaborative with a strong sense of initiative</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Language Skills: Fluency in English and French </p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Travel Required</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">This role is fully remote and may require up to 50% of travel to be successful. Job-related travel expenses are reviewed and must be approved by your manager.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Perks of </strong><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="http://Horizon3.ai"><strong>Horizon3</strong></a></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Inclusive Team: We value diversity and promote an inclusive culture where everyone can thrive.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Growth Opportunities: Be part of a dynamic and growing team with numerous career development opportunities.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Innovative Culture: Work in a collaborative environment that encourages creativity and out-of-the-box thinking.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Competitive Compensation: We offer competitive salary, equity and benefits.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Compensation and Values</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">At Horizon3, we believe that our people are our greatest asset, and our compensation philosophy reflects this core value. We are committed to fostering an environment where all employees feel valued, respected, and rewarded for their contributions. Our compensation structure is designed to be fair, competitive, and transparent, ensuring that every team member is recognized and compensated equitably across roles, levels, and locations.</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Depending on experience, the compensation range for this position is: €160,000 - €190,000 OTE 70/30 split annually. The exact salary will be determined based on the selected candidate’s location, qualifications, experience, and relevant skills.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Additional compensation: All full-time roles are eligible for an equity package in the form of stock options.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>You Belong Here</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Horizon3 is not just an equal opportunity employer - we are a community that values diversity, equity, and inclusion as fundamental principles of our culture and success. We are dedicated to fostering a workplace where everyone feels welcome and respected, regardless of race, color, religion, sex, national origin, age, disability, veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, genetic information, marital status, hair length or any other legally protected status by law.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Our commitment to diversity and inclusion means we strive to attract, develop, and retain a workforce that reflects the varied communities we serve. We believe that diverse perspectives drive innovation and strengthen our ability to create cutting-edge cybersecurity solutions. At Horizon3, every team member is valued and supported in an environment that encourages personal and professional growth.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We welcome candidates from all backgrounds and experiences, and we encourage all qualified individuals to apply. Come be a part of Horizon3, where your unique contributions are recognized, and your potential is limitless.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Other Duties</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Please note this job description is not designed to cover or contain a comprehensive listing of activities, duties or responsibilities that are required of the employee. Duties, responsibilities, and activities may change at any time with or without notice. </p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Application Note</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">In any materials you submit, you may redact or remove age-identifying information such as age, date of birth, or dates of school attendance or graduation. You will not be penalized for redacting or removing this information.</p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/horizon3ai/senior-sales-engineer-france-272217","tags":["Sales"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"France","created_at":1793914817},{"slug":"compliance-director-france-413144","company_name":"Bjak","title":"Compliance Director","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>About Doit</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We are focused on reinventing how people spend, save, invest, exchange, travel, and more. Our objective is to build tools that will help people get more from their money and become an expert at ease. We believe AI will help make finance smart, accessible and safe.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We are looking for the most talented and driven people we can find. We are looking for people who work for their passion, not counting hours. Who lov