stody, fund and banking partners.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own the business plan, financial projections, capital plan and budget.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Launch the investment platform in Lithuania and roll it out across the EEA.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Set up governance, policies and controls that meet EU and Lithuanian requirements.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work with group leadership on product, engineering and growth.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Report to the board and take ownership of business and regulatory outcomes.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What We’re Looking For</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Generalist background in consulting, investment banking, start-ups, private equity or venture capital.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience building or scaling a business, ideally in financial services or fintech.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong problem-solving skills and business judgment.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ability to learn regulation quickly and work credibly with regulators.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong ownership and execution skills.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills, with boards, regulators, partners and teams.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Comfortable working across product, operations, finance and compliance.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A clean record and good reputation, suitable for regulatory approval as a senior manager.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Based in Lithuania, or open to relocating to Lithuania.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Curious, resourceful, and driven to build.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Nice to Have</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p st