ium.com/qonto-way/ai-at-qonto-vision-statement-725a7e2f659b"><em><strong><u>here</u></strong></em></a>)<em> - </em>Every Qontoer gets unlimited access to the best AI tools. We want people who experiment without waiting for permission, push AI beyond the obvious, know when to trust it, and when to question it.<br /><br /><br /></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Join our French AML team as an <strong>AML Officer</strong> and help protect Qonto and its customers from money laundering and terrorist financing. You’ll investigate complex alerts and help refine our controls, under the guidance of <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/amilcar-reyes-g/">Amilcar</a>, our Senior Lead AML/CFT..</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>➡️ What you’ll do</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Investigate complex alerts:</strong> You handle transaction monitoring alerts and suspicious activity reports, around 25 alerts a day.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Control quality:</strong> You run first-level controls and internal checks to make sure the team’s work follows our procedures. </p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Improve how we work:</strong> You spot gaps in our processes and lead projects that make daily operations more efficient.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Coach the team:</strong> You act as a go-to referent and share your expertise on complex cases, from sanctions to terrorism financing.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Be our voice on complex topics:</strong> You’re the reliable contact for internal teams, and for auditors and regulators when needed.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>➡️ What we’re looking for</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>AML/CFT experience:</strong> You have 1–3 years in trans