54889075 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW254889075 BCX0"><span style="color:#000000">Developing actionable recommendations and strategic plans tailored to each client's needs&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW254889075 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW254889075 BCX0"><span style="color:#000000">Ensuring the quality and accuracy of deliverables, reports, and client presentations&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW254889075 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW254889075 BCX0"><span style="color:#000000">Supporting business development by identifying potential clients and contributing to proposals&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW254889075 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW254889075 BCX0"><span style="color:#000000">Staying ahead of industry trends, emerging technologies, and best practices in strategy consulting and digital transformation&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><p class="Paragraph SCXW254889075 BCX0"><span style="color:#000000">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW254889075 BCX0"><strong><span style="color:#000000">Who you are</span></strong><span style="color:#000000">&nbsp;</span></p><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW254889075 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW254889075 BCX0"><span style="color:#000000">4–6 years of experience at a top-tier consulting firm, with a focus on digital and/or tech transformation&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW254889075 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW254889075 BCX0"><span style="color:#000000">Strong understanding of digital technologies, trends, and their applications in business&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW254889075 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW254889075 BCX0"><span style="color:#000000">Proven ability to turn quantitative and qualitative analysis into actionable strategy&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW254889075 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW254889075 BCX0"><span sty